WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.723 --> 00:00:03.366
- The very first time I left the ground

00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:05.476
in a gyroplane, I knew it was over.

00:00:05.476 --> 00:00:06.963
My life was done, it was always

00:00:06.963 --> 00:00:08.376
going to be about gyroplanes.

00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:11.232
And it was not just
because I was in the air,

00:00:11.232 --> 00:00:13.630
but I was depending upon myself,

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.003
so my safety was in my own hands.

00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:18.706
It was one of the most
exhilarating sensations

00:00:18.706 --> 00:00:21.623
that I've ever received in my life.

00:00:25.176 --> 00:00:28.455
My name is George Jacob,
and I'm known as “Gyro Jake.”

00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:31.205
I build gyroplanes from scratch.

00:00:32.655 --> 00:00:36.494
What a gyroplane is,
basically a hybrid airplane

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.940
helicopter, but it's neither of the two.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.560
How many gyroplanes?

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.658
I would say I've built close to 20.

00:00:43.658 --> 00:00:47.227
I lost count around 13 a few years back.

00:00:47.227 --> 00:00:50.174
I imagine what I want, and what components

00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:52.166
should fit together, then I machine out

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:54.293
and weld up the parts that are necessary

00:00:54.293 --> 00:00:56.290
to get the job completed.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.682
So sometimes it can take two months,

00:00:57.682 --> 00:00:58.972
sometimes it can take a year.

00:00:58.972 --> 00:01:00.589
There's times I look at it, and I go,

00:01:00.589 --> 00:01:02.540
"Man, I did that, and it works?!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.290
"And I wanna fly it?"

00:01:06.504 --> 00:01:08.590
When I first started it was a pretty small

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.274
clique in Florida.

00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:12.306
And so we'd get together on the weekends.

00:01:12.306 --> 00:01:15.634
Today, the gyro community has probably

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:17.805
increased by a hundred-
fold, especially with

00:01:17.805 --> 00:01:21.071
the new revolution of
the factory-built gyros.

00:01:21.071 --> 00:01:24.403
The do-it-yourself builders
are kind of like the dinosaurs.

00:01:24.403 --> 00:01:26.702
They're on their way to being extinct.

00:01:26.702 --> 00:01:28.144
There aren't many people that spend

00:01:28.144 --> 00:01:31.036
most of their free time
building a gyroplane,

00:01:31.036 --> 00:01:32.929
one after the other, after the other.

00:01:32.929 --> 00:01:35.430
There's no incentive, like money,

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.704
that compels me to do this.

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:39.956
It's just because this is my pleasure,

00:01:39.956 --> 00:01:42.873
this is my joy, this is my passion.

